# Cloudflare Pages headers
# Lives in /public so Vite copies it to the dist root on build.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/

# This map is embedded into the event's Webflow site via an <iframe>.
# We intentionally do NOT set X-Frame-Options or a CSP frame-ancestors rule here,
# so the page can be embedded from any domain. This guarantees the embed works
# regardless of which Webflow domain the integration team uses (staging *.webflow.io,
# the live custom domain, etc.) with no further config on our side.
#
# OPTIONAL — to restrict embedding to specific domains later, uncomment the line
# below and replace the domains with the real published Webflow URLs:
#   Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self' https://*.webflow.io https://your-event-domain.com

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# Long-cache the immutable, fingerprinted build assets (Vite hashes these filenames).
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
